From cd2394183043b71fa069245f5eec428437790bbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Kenney <dylanmkenney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:22:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] core/qmlglobal: add requestActivationToken()

Requests a token from the shared activation helper and passes it to a
JS callback, so QML can pass one to a program it launches, e.g. to raise
an app that is already running.

The token arrives asynchronously, so this takes a callback instead of
blocking the UI thread until the compositor answers.
